 "notes": "v23 enemy (Hollow region): the Caster, ranged special, personality spiteful. A fluffy green moss ball on two brown clawed front paws (x -0.31/+0.27; one leg-pair bone) with a fur tuft behind at the left, a smug face low on the front (x ~+0.15), two tall pink antler-feathers (rigid squash followers) and a floating green crescent (its own closed shell) between them. The crescent is a HOVER part (v23): a child of root keyed from its own world-offset channels, so it bobs, rises and spins on its own; its glow shell (meshfix/caster_glow.py) has its own child bone, held collapsed except in Cast, and no ink outline (outline_mask_zero). The body is a slightly diagonal oval (the input art was a 3/4 view); the face, the paws and the crescent all face -Y, so no prep rotation."
